    "collapsible_content_QAcDQm": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_rpGfjz": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does it work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The AoraLight is a plug-in night light that uses a built-in dusk to dawn sensor that can automatically turn the night light off during the day and on at night. You can also manually adjust its brightness to your preferred level.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_AzyzJQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I have a horizontal outlet?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>That's not a problem! The Aoralight has a rotatable plug so you can use it on both vertical and horizontal outlets.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_P3xLYE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it consume a lot of energy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No, the AoraLight is energy-efficient. The light sensor ensures it only operates when needed, and its LED technology consumes minimal power while providing ample illumination.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_fA7i9G": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use multiple in one room?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, you can use multiple AoraLights in a single room to create a layered or uniform lighting effect, depending on your preferences and needs.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ft6dx3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use it in children's bedrooms?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely. The AoraLight's gentle and customizable illumination makes it an excellent choice for children's bedrooms, providing a comforting and safe night light.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_9KaWDq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it safe to use continuously?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the AoraLight is designed for continuous use. Its LED technology produces minimal heat, making it safe for extended operation.</p>",
            "page": ""
